# Line endings: the repository stores LF and every checkout gets LF, on every
# platform. This overrides a machine-level `core.autocrlf=true` (Git for Windows
# default), which would otherwise check text files out as CRLF and make
# Prettier's `endOfLine: "lf"` (its default) fail on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files are never converted (text=auto already detects them; listed for clarity).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.tgz binary
